oṃ hāṃ śrīṃ bhaṃ dviraṇḍavajranīśaktibhyāṃ namaśśivābhyāṃ namaḥ| iti nābhau| (c1, l7.)
oṃ hāṃ śrīṃ maṃ mahākālajayāśaktibhyāṃ namaśśivābhyāṃ namaḥ| iti hṛdaye| (c2, l1.)
oṃ hāṃ śrīṃ yaṃ kapālisumukheśvarīśaktibhyāṃ namaśśivābhyāṃ namaḥ| iti tvaci| (c2, l2.)
